    new {
      name = "Week 9-12: Reverse Pyramid"
      description = #"Now that you're primed from the underload variations, in this block you'll move to overload variations, which prioritizes weight.\n\nIn this phase you'll be doing the reverse pyramid set and rep scheme, which means prioritizing heavy weights for your first set, then lower load with high reps in later sets.\n\nBy the end of this program, you'll look like you can scale the Empire State Building."#
      order = 3
